      "message": "commented but This does not need to be called from one thread. It\u0027s accessed only inside isAnyTcpSocketConnectedForFamily(). In theory, isAnyTcpSocketConnectedForFamily() is possible to called from different threads. The only impact will be the message for each message will be created more than once and overwrite it in the array. The message will be no difference creating from different threads.\n\nI still put the comment since this may be confusing.",
